---
source: src/tests/cli_tests.rs
expression: help_text
---
Find duplicated Rust code blocks

Usage: cargo-duplicated [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          Path to scan
          
          [default: .]

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>
          Path to config file (defaults to <path>/dups.toml)

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

      --include-tests
          Include files under tests/

      --exclude <EXCLUDE>
          Exclude path glob (relative to root). Can be repeated

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
